{"2912780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MINDFLUX: Dead Man Walking", "steam_appid": 2912780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a roleplaying system that provides a number of approaches to influence NPCs. Prioritize deduction over luck with the absence of RNG from skill checks. Through careful observation, determine which aptitudes suspects are weak to and resistant against. Fail due to bad decisions, not random chance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter nightmares from the 37th century. You hit hard, but your enemies hit harder. Approach each combat encounter with strategic builds and tactical precision. Find clues about your enemies' weaknesses and exploit them in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted, non-linear dungeons. Platform across collapsing infrastructure, navigate ancient traps, and face dangerous enemies. Find your way by studying ancient maps, environmental clues, and dubious advice from locals. Stray off the beaten path to uncover hidden secrets and powerful loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain various body augments as quest rewards or through exploration. Install them to gain new abilities, then layer them to discover unique effects and synergies. Experiment with combinations and alter your build to tangibly change how you approach traversal, combat, investigation, and dialogue encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a richly crafted dystopian world full of unique factions, unusual customs, and strange locations where humanity stands on the edge of extinction in the 37th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>cybernetic detective</strong> on the brink of insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for a <strong>vanished doctor</strong> in a labyrinthine quarry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your psyche</strong> to manipulate others and <strong>alter outcomes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain your <strong>sanity for insight</strong> as hallucinations take hold.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore long-forgotten depths where <strong>truth and nightmare intertwine</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b9e94126300f5aff693a16f737280a43.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a roleplaying system that provides a number of approaches to influence NPCs. Prioritize deduction over luck with the absence of RNG from skill checks. Through careful observation, determine which aptitudes suspects are weak to and resistant against. Fail due to bad decisions, not random chance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/28ee3111218d89a51eebe253cb6a4bac.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter nightmares from the 37th century. You hit hard, but your enemies hit harder. Approach each combat encounter with strategic builds and tactical precision. Find clues about your enemies' weaknesses and exploit them in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/de793511b5b472c722770779f6e420c1.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted, non-linear dungeons. Platform across collapsing infrastructure, navigate ancient traps, and face dangerous enemies. Find your way by studying ancient maps, environmental clues, and dubious advice from locals. Stray off the beaten path to uncover hidden secrets and powerful loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/b7d0a34bd9367f5f96e8211144be72f7.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain various body augments as quest rewards or through exploration. Install them to gain new abilities, then layer them to discover unique effects and synergies. Experiment with combinations and alter your build to tangibly change how you approach traversal, combat, investigation, and dialogue encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.poster.avif?t=1786557226\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.webm?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912780/extras/d64a6e6d6cea655de78eca35d432a9a6.mp4?t=1786557226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a richly crafted dystopian world full of unique factions, unusual customs, and strange locations where humanity stands on the edge of extinction in the 37th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>cybernetic detective</strong> on the brink of insanity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for a <strong>vanished doctor</strong> in a labyrinthine quarry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment your psyche</strong> to manipulate others and <strong>alter outcomes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain your <strong>sanity for insight</strong> as hallucinations take hold.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore long-forgotten depths where <strong>truth and nightmare intertwine</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a cybernetic detective on the brink of madness. The only doctor who can save you is missing. Modify your brain to extract clues, platform across collapsing infrastructure to solve puzzles, and weaponize ancient technology to fend off unspeakable nightmares in this first-person horror RPG.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps